{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your basketball dynasty in <i>Draft Day Sports: Pro Basketball 26</i>, the deepest and most customizable pro basketball management simulation available. Step into the role of general manager  as you draft, trade, and develop players while managing the salary cap and long-term team building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This year\u2019s version features a refreshed, modern UI for a smoother experience, a new player archetype system to help identify roles and playing styles, smarter AI that adapts and creates unique league storylines, and expanded game presentation updates that bring your vision to life on the court.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your universe with powerful editing tools \u2014 create teams, players, logos, and even entire leagues to design the basketball world of your dreams. Whether you want to recreate today\u2019s pro landscape, build your own fictional league, or relive historic eras, <i>DDS: Pro Basketball 26</i> gives you the tools to do it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With deep strategy, immersive presentation, and unlimited customization, no other basketball sim delivers a franchise experience like this.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3914210?t=1762373349","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914210/c0f7e129ecf7dfe70608991c5f03d2525d98552c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762373349","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914210/1c3562fd238721a4134be1eeb3b5b110513c71f9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762373349","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914210/1c3562fd238721a4134be1eeb3b5b110513c71f9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762373349","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your basketball dynasty in <i>Draft Day Sports: Pro Basketball 26</i>, the deepest and most customizable pro basketball management simulation available. Step into the role of general manager  as you draft, trade, and develop players while managing the salary cap and long-term team building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This year\u2019s version features a refreshed, modern UI for a smoother experience, a new player archetype system to help identify roles and playing styles, smarter AI that adapts and creates unique league storylines, and expanded game presentation updates that bring your vision to life on the court.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your universe with powerful editing tools \u2014 create teams, players, logos, and even entire leagues to design the basketball world of your dreams. Whether you want to recreate today\u2019s pro landscape, build your own fictional league, or relive historic eras, <i>DDS: Pro Basketball 26</i> gives you the tools to do it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With deep strategy, immersive presentation, and unlimited customization, no other basketball sim delivers a franchise experience like this.</p>","developers":["Wolverine Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914210/f595aa8a5b2317e6a2ac3a1b365db88cd71fc96f/header.jpg?t=1762373349","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3914210/2145939015/70d9b36be64eec253e0c632ec3049cda17a